```
Redemption of the receipt token will depend on the current ratio of the Backing Reserve in rDPX and ETH and a variable redemption fee is charged to redeem receipt tokens. For eg. if 1 receipt token represents 1 ETH/dpxETH LP token which carries 0.5 ETH and 0.5 dpxETH, then during redemption the LP token is removed from the curve pool, the 0.5 dpxETH is burnt and 0.5 eth + the current ratio of backing is returned to the user with the redemption fee charged.
