# Vulnerability details

## Impact
There is an event created which needs to be emitted when an emergency withdrawal takes place, however when this event is not used, there will be no off-chain information incase an emergency withdrawal takes place which can be problematic as this function has the power to withdraw all of the funds that are being held.

## Proof of Concept
https://github.com/code-423n4/2023-08-dopex/blob/eb4d4a201b3a75dd4bddc74a34e9c42c71d0d12f/contracts/decaying-bonds/RdpxDecayingBonds.sol#L89-L107

The event created is:
  ```event EmergencyWithdraw(address sender);```

However, it is not used for the emergency withdrawal function in DecayingBonds.sol that can be seen here: 
 ``` function emergencyWithdraw(
    address[] calldata tokens,
    bool transferNative,
