# Vulnerability details



Delegate bonding allow users to delegate ETH for others to bond with their rDPX tokens using `bondWithDelegate()`. The delegate can set a fee for usage of their ETH.
`bondWithDelegate()` will call `_calculateAmounts()` to determine the delegate fee and the delegate will receive the delegate fee in the form of rDPX bond.

However, `_calculateAmounts()` incorrectly calculates the delegate fee as it is applied on the rDPX tokens. The delegate fee should be applied on the ETH used for delegate bonding.


https://github.com/code-423n4/2023-08-dopex/blob/main/contracts/core/RdpxV2Core.sol#L612

