If we look at RdpxV2Core.sol#L612 (code above), the delegateFee is applied on `amount1`, which is the portion of bond `_amount` based on `rdpxRequiredInWeth` (derived from `_rdpxRequired`). The correct implementation should apply the delegateFee on `_wethRequired` and then use that to reduce `amount1`.

